The legislative texts in this repository are from Lógasavnið, https://logir.fo, the Faroese law collection
published by Løgmansskrivstovan. Official texts are not protected by copyright in the Faroe Islands:
Løgtingslóg nr. 30 frá 30. apríl 2015 um upphavsrætt, § 9, stk. 1 ("Lógir, kunngerðir, rundskriv frá
myndugleikum, reglugerðir, dómar og onnur líknandi skjøl, sum tað almenna letur gera, eru ikki vard av
upphavsrætti."). The texts are reproduced without change to their wording; only the arrangement (one file per §,
one paragraph per line) is Lexifina's. Only the text published in Kunngerðablaðið is binding. This repository is
private.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
